{
  "//": [
    "Realtime Database rules — only used when VITE_FIREBASE_DATABASE_URL is set",
    "(donations are then stored here instead of in Firestore).",
    "",
    "The app mirrors the admin roster into /admins/<uid> = true so these rules",
    "can authorise writes without reaching into Firestore.",
    "",
    "FIRST-RUN BOOTSTRAP: the /admins node is writable by any signed-in user",
    "so the very first administrator can be recorded. Once the owner exists,",
    "replace the /admins .write rule with:",
    "    \".write\": \"auth != null && root.child('admins/' + auth.uid).exists()\"",
    "and redeploy:  firebase deploy --only database"
  ],
  "rules": {
    "admins": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      ".write": "auth != null",
      "$uid": {
        ".validate": "newData.isBoolean()"
      }
    },
    "donations": {
      ".read": "auth != null && root.child('admins/' + auth.uid).exists()",
      ".write": "auth != null && root.child('admins/' + auth.uid).exists()",
      "$month": {
        ".validate": "$month.matches(/^\\d{4}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])$/)",
        "$funderId": {
          "name": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 200" },
          "phone": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 60" },
          "amount": { ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() >= 0" },
          "savedAt": { ".validate": "newData.isNumber()" },
          "$other": { ".validate": false }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
